## case in a conclusion
  expr             text     expr
  ENum             text     ENum
  EContains        text     EContains
  ENop             text     ENop

## case with no arguments
  ENop             text     ENop

## function after a dollar
  $lookup          text     $lookup

## relation after a dash
  if               text      if
  otherwise        text      otherwise
  Eval             text      Eval

